WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.787
Welcome back to Building
the Daily Checks Workbook.

2
00:00:02.787 --> 00:00:06.825
This is Chapter 2: the workbook's
template, and its validator.

3
00:00:06.825 --> 00:00:10.598
A workbook edited in the portal
is a change nobody reviewed,

4
00:00:10.598 --> 00:00:15.063
so the kit keeps it as a file and
checks every copy against the manifest.

5
00:00:15.063 --> 00:00:19.820
We'll start from Microsoft Learn's page on
workbooks as Resource Manager templates,

6
00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:22.922
see what it leaves to you,
read how the template is built

7
00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:26.025
and the ten checks the validator
runs, and walk two labs.

8
00:00:26.025 --> 00:00:29.020
The chapter is a draft
awaiting the owner's review.
